  "version": "1.15.34",
  "channel": "testing",
  "notes": "- **The screen can now turn off on its own hours.** On the Screensaver card,\n  \"When the screen may turn off\" can follow the screensaver's hours (as\n  before), allow any time, or use its own hours. So the screensaver can run\n  all day while the screen only turns off after hours, and it comes back on\n  when those hours end. Displays keep their current behaviour until this is\n  changed.\n- **Displays are ready to take settings sent from the management console**\n  (the page, permissions, screensaver, keyboard, clock and admin password),\n  so they can be changed on many displays at once. A display checks every\n  value before changing anything, and changes nothing if any value is\n  wrong. Sending settings from the console is not switched on yet.",
